            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 18.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“The priests have the priesthood as their share of what I have given Israel to be handed down from one generation to another. They are not to hold property in Israel; I am all they need. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.8+NUM.18.9+NUM.18.10+NUM.18.11+NUM.18.12+NUM.18.13+NUM.18.14+NUM.18.15+NUM.18.16+NUM.18.17+NUM.18.18+NUM.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 18.8–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The grain offerings, the sin offerings and the repayment offerings will be the priests' food, and they are to receive everything in Israel that is set apart for me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priests are to have the best of all the first harvest and of everything else that is offered to me. Each time the people bake bread, they are to give the priests the first loaf as an offering, and my blessing will rest on their homes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.22.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 22.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priests must not eat any bird or animal that dies a natural death or is killed by another animal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
